# Local Skein orchestration/runtime state
.skein/
.opencode/agents

# `.opencode/agent/*.md` used to be ignored because skein symlinked those names
# into a `.skein/agents/` directory. That was the wrong shape — `.skein/` is
# local per-repo state, not a shared library — and the links dangled from the
# day this repo was renamed. The personas are tracked files now.
# Skein's own seeded links, should they reappear, are caught here:
.opencode/agent/_synth-*.md

